    answerEn: 'Decision fatigue. Every meeting asks you to process, judge, and react emotionally. Your brain tires from processing information just like your body tires from lifting weights.',
    actionEn: 'Do a "mind dump": write down everything that\'s on your mind right now — work, personal, unfinished. Feel the relief? That\'s your brain\'s RAM clearing.',
